{
  "loads": true,
  "name": "hook-merger",
  "nameSource": "manifest",
  "hooks": {
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Write|Edit",
        "command": "\"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/format.sh\"",
        "args": []
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Read",
        "command": "\"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/check.sh\"",
        "args": []
      }
    ],
    "Notification": [
      {
        "matcher": null,
        "command": "\"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/notify.sh\"",
        "args": []
      }
    ]
  },
  "basis": "PLG:151/:264 与 CMP:747：hooks/hooks.json 与清单 hooks 都装载、合并；PLG:260-262 hooks 文件（hooks/hooks.json 与清单指的文件）必须带顶层 \"hooks\" 包裹，内联对象本身就是事件表；本样本三个来源用不同事件，避开「同事件内怎么并」这一原文未说明点"
}
